# pxx.skip — known-fail list for tools/run_fgl_corpus.sh (Pascal corpus rung 2:
# real FPC 3.2.2 fgl.pp). One driver per line: "name.pas<TAB>reason".
# Every entry MUST reference its backlog ticket. Anything failing and NOT listed
# here is a regression and reds the rung. Remove the line when the ticket is
# fixed — the runner then enforces the pass.
#
# Baseline 2026-08-25 (pxx VERSION 374): 3 pass / 4 known-fail of 7 drivers.
# All seven build and run correctly under FPC 3.2.2, which is where the
# .expected files come from — so every entry below is a pxx gap, never a bad
# driver.
ifclist.pas	gap: `Pointer(Dest^) := Pointer(Src^)` — cast-as-lvalue resolves a class type name but not a builtin one (fgl.pp:1189). bug-p-a-cast-as-lvalue-does-not-accept-a-builtin-type-name
list_str.pas	gap: `T(p^)` with T = string — `String(...)` is routed to the conversion intrinsic instead of a typecast (fgl.pp:892). bug-p-a-string-typecast-is-a-conversion-and-not-a-cast
map_str.pas	gap: same String-typecast wall on the map key path (fgl.pp:1602). bug-p-a-string-typecast-is-a-conversion-and-not-a-cast
objectlist.pas	gap: `inherited Create` where TFPSList.Create has a defaulted parameter — `inherited call argument count mismatch` (fgl.pp:1061). bug-p-inherited-ignores-the-parents-default-parameter-values
